{"id": "p5-021", "text": "大老爷们儿还计较这点小事，不像话。", "gold": 1, "targets": ["male"], "phenomena": ["role_constraint"], "case_type": "false_negative", "models": {"p2-selected": {"label": 0, "score": 0.15160258061339943, "threshold": 0.4, "is_mock": false}, "p2-char1-3gram": {"label": 0, "score": 0.172775353652578, "threshold": 0.4, "is_mock": false}, "improved-i1-s42": {"label": 0, "score": 0.00971645675599575, "threshold": 0.5, "is_mock": false}, "improved-i2-s42": {"label": 0, "score": 0.017706524580717087, "threshold": 0.5, "is_mock": false}}, "explanation": "假阴性。偏见来自“大老爷们儿”这一口语称谓加“不像话”的角色规范，但该类口语词在训练词表中稀疏（全表仅5,288维），信号弱，得分0.15。", "note_source": "human"}
{"id": "p5-082", "text": "跨性别者心理都有问题，最好别打交道。", "gold": 1, "targets": ["other_explicit"], "phenomena": ["other_identity_derogation"], "case_type": "false_negative", "models": {"p2-selected": {"label": 0, "score": 0.21266118180863447, "threshold": 0.4, "is_mock": false}, "p2-char1-3gram": {"label": 0, "score": 0.23242856595231448, "threshold": 0.4, "is_mock": false}, "improved-i1-s42": {"label": 0, "score": 0.00023045396665111184, "threshold": 0.5, "is_mock": false}, "improved-i2-s42": {"label": 0, "score": 0.09868192672729492, "threshold": 0.5, "is_mock": false}}, "explanation": "假阴性。句子是明显的污名化，但“跨性别”不是训练集常见词；“心理”“问题”等非性别词无法提供足够证据，得分0.21，说明词表外身份偏见被系统性漏检。", "note_source": "human"}
{"id": "p5-086", "text": "非二元性别只是跟风赶时髦，过两年就消停了。", "gold": 1, "targets": ["other_explicit"], "phenomena": ["other_identity_derogation", "implicit_stereotype"], "case_type": "false_negative", "models": {"p2-selected": {"label": 0, "score": 0.22011317281475368, "threshold": 0.4, "is_mock": false}, "p2-char1-3gram": {"label": 0, "score": 0.26156167781460615, "threshold": 0.4, "is_mock": false}, "improved-i1-s42": {"label": 0, "score": 0.0002348620182601735, "threshold": 0.5, "is_mock": false}, "improved-i2-s42": {"label": 0, "score": 0.019817061722278595, "threshold": 0.5, "is_mock": false}}, "explanation": "假阴性。“非二元性别只是跟风赶时髦”是身份贬低加隐性刻板印象；“非二元”属词表外身份词，模型只捕捉到“跟风”“时髦”，0.22。", "note_source": "human"}
{"id": "p5-018", "text": "他长得文文弱弱，做事肯定靠不住。", "gold": 1, "targets": ["male"], "phenomena": ["appearance_inference"], "case_type": "false_negative", "models": {"p2-selected": {"label": 0, "score": 0.25157011458045175, "threshold": 0.4, "is_mock": false}, "p2-char1-3gram": {"label": 0, "score": 0.27177070518930185, "threshold": 0.4, "is_mock": false}, "improved-i1-s42": {"label": 0, "score": 0.0020724020432680845, "threshold": 0.5, "is_mock": false}, "improved-i2-s42": {"label": 0, "score": 0.009863379411399364, "threshold": 0.5, "is_mock": false}}, "explanation": "假阴性。“文文弱弱”由外貌推断可靠性，模型缺少“文弱→靠不住”这一组合；单字特征只看到“弱”“不”，与性格评价样本重合不足，得分0.25。", "note_source": "human"}
{"id": "p5-012", "text": "老公在家带娃做饭，说出去多没面子。", "gold": 1, "targets": ["male"], "phenomena": ["implicit_stereotype"], "case_type": "false_negative", "models": {"p2-selected": {"label": 0, "score": 0.3483567216405677, "threshold": 0.4, "is_mock": false}, "p2-char1-3gram": {"label": 1, "score": 0.49205986911791644, "threshold": 0.4, "is_mock": false}, "improved-i1-s42": {"label": 1, "score": 0.9872325658798218, "threshold": 0.5, "is_mock": false}, "improved-i2-s42": {"label": 0, "score": 0.08238216489553452, "threshold": 0.5, "is_mock": false}}, "explanation": "假阴性。“老公在家带娃做饭……没面子”是男性角色限制加社会羞耻，但句子没有“男人就该”类训练模板，词面证据弱（0.35）。", "note_source": "human"}
{"id": "p5-097", "text": "男性和女性的差异常被过度强调。", "gold": 0, "targets": ["unspecified"], "phenomena": ["bias_awareness"], "case_type": "false_positive", "models": {"p2-selected": {"label": 1, "score": 0.97243548182754, "threshold": 0.4, "is_mock": false}, "p2-char1-3gram": {"label": 1, "score": 0.910807114699262, "threshold": 0.4, "is_mock": false}, "improved-i1-s42": {"label": 0, "score": 0.0021256287582218647, "threshold": 0.5, "is_mock": false}, "improved-i2-s42": {"label": 1, "score": 0.6272255778312683, "threshold": 0.5, "is_mock": false}}, "explanation": "假阳性。“男性”“女性”“差异”三个词与训练集显性刻板印象句高度重合；字符1-gram特征无法表示“被过度强调”的批判语气，于是把对偏见的讨论判成偏见本身。", "note_source": "human"}
{"id": "p5-090", "text": "不管男女还是非二元，能力才是标准。", "gold": 0, "targets": ["other_explicit"], "phenomena": ["denial_of_bias"], "case_type": "false_positive", "models": {"p2-selected": {"label": 1, "score": 0.9678229934258372, "threshold": 0.4, "is_mock": false}, "p2-char1-3gram": {"label": 1, "score": 0.9101010496433901, "threshold": 0.4, "is_mock": false}, "improved-i1-s42": {"label": 1, "score": 0.6779611110687256, "threshold": 0.5, "is_mock": false}, "improved-i2-s42": {"label": 1, "score": 0.8520846366882324, "threshold": 0.5, "is_mock": false}}, "explanation": "假阳性。“男女”“非二元”命中身份词，“不管……能力才是标准”是让步结构；模型没有句法表示，读不出后半句的反偏见主张。", "note_source": "human"}
{"id": "p5-078", "text": "她是两个孩子的妈妈，也是公司的合伙人。", "gold": 0, "targets": ["female"], "phenomena": ["neutral_description"], "case_type": "false_positive", "models": {"p2-selected": {"label": 1, "score": 0.965801028558268, "threshold": 0.4, "is_mock": false}, "p2-char1-3gram": {"label": 1, "score": 0.9528159298638911, "threshold": 0.4, "is_mock": false}, "improved-i1-s42": {"label": 1, "score": 0.9911715388298035, "threshold": 0.5, "is_mock": false}, "improved-i2-s42": {"label": 1, "score": 0.9673474431037903, "threshold": 0.5, "is_mock": false}}, "explanation": "假阳性。“妈妈”在训练集中多与“带孩子、顾家”共现，“也是公司的合伙人”提供的反证据没有被利用，并列身份被压成家庭角色信号。", "note_source": "human"}
{"id": "p5-096", "text": "这个社会对男女的要求不一样，但不该如此。", "gold": 0, "targets": ["unspecified"], "phenomena": ["bias_awareness"], "case_type": "false_positive", "models": {"p2-selected": {"label": 1, "score": 0.9509300308784516, "threshold": 0.4, "is_mock": false}, "p2-char1-3gram": {"label": 1, "score": 0.7867416288216745, "threshold": 0.4, "is_mock": false}, "improved-i1-s42": {"label": 1, "score": 0.9920307397842407, "threshold": 0.5, "is_mock": false}, "improved-i2-s42": {"label": 1, "score": 0.869269847869873, "threshold": 0.5, "is_mock": false}}, "explanation": "假阳性。前半句“对男女的要求不一样”与角色限制句词面相似，转折“但不该如此”才是否定态度的所在；字符n-gram不编码转折关系。", "note_source": "human"}
{"id": "p5-074", "text": "别拿“贤惠”要求所有女人。", "gold": 0, "targets": ["female"], "phenomena": ["denial_of_bias"], "case_type": "false_positive", "models": {"p2-selected": {"label": 1, "score": 0.9161002689113303, "threshold": 0.4, "is_mock": false}, "p2-char1-3gram": {"label": 1, "score": 0.9493538680156859, "threshold": 0.4, "is_mock": false}, "improved-i1-s42": {"label": 1, "score": 0.9988895058631897, "threshold": 0.5, "is_mock": false}, "improved-i2-s42": {"label": 1, "score": 0.9845518469810486, "threshold": 0.5, "is_mock": false}}, "explanation": "假阳性。“贤惠”“要求所有女人”与训练集的善意性别歧视/角色限制句词面重合，祈使否定“别拿”没有对应特征。", "note_source": "human"}
{"id": "p5-061", "text": "女人要温柔贤惠，太能干了男人不喜欢。", "gold": 1, "targets": ["female"], "phenomena": ["benevolent_sexism", "role_constraint"], "case_type": "true_positive", "models": {"p2-selected": {"label": 1, "score": 0.9979837176005006, "threshold": 0.4, "is_mock": false}, "p2-char1-3gram": {"label": 1, "score": 0.9943744109526699, "threshold": 0.4, "is_mock": false}, "improved-i1-s42": {"label": 1, "score": 0.9992725253105164, "threshold": 0.5, "is_mock": false}, "improved-i2-s42": {"label": 1, "score": 0.993073046207428, "threshold": 0.5, "is_mock": false}}, "explanation": "真阳性。“女人要……”“贤惠”与训练集的角色限制和善意性别歧视句高度重合，可解释的高分（0.998）。", "note_source": "human"}
{"id": "p5-038", "text": "这位父亲每天接送孩子，邻居早就习以为常。", "gold": 0, "targets": ["male"], "phenomena": ["neutral_description"], "case_type": "true_negative", "models": {"p2-selected": {"label": 0, "score": 0.11798428323818909, "threshold": 0.4, "is_mock": false}, "p2-char1-3gram": {"label": 0, "score": 0.17727656026658542, "threshold": 0.4, "is_mock": false}, "improved-i1-s42": {"label": 0, "score": 0.0003531039983499795, "threshold": 0.5, "is_mock": false}, "improved-i2-s42": {"label": 0, "score": 0.016081441193819046, "threshold": 0.5, "is_mock": false}}, "explanation": "真阴性。“父亲”“接送孩子”不带评价性性别词，训练集中该搭配不是偏见样本，0.118的低分是正确的放过。", "note_source": "human"}
{"id": "p5-091", "text": "男人理性，女人感性，这是天性。", "gold": 1, "targets": ["male", "female"], "phenomena": ["explicit_stereotype"], "case_type": "true_positive", "models": {"p2-selected": {"label": 1, "score": 0.9903949542472328, "threshold": 0.4, "is_mock": false}, "p2-char1-3gram": {"label": 1, "score": 0.9754471841100149, "threshold": 0.4, "is_mock": false}, "improved-i1-s42": {"label": 1, "score": 0.9967634677886963, "threshold": 0.5, "is_mock": false}, "improved-i2-s42": {"label": 1, "score": 0.9626806974411011, "threshold": 0.5, "is_mock": false}}, "explanation": "真阳性。“男人……女人……这是天性”几乎是训练集显性刻板印象的模板句，0.990的高分来自模板匹配。", "note_source": "human"}
{"id": "p5-040", "text": "他说话温和，同事觉得和他沟通很顺畅。", "gold": 0, "targets": ["male"], "phenomena": ["neutral_description"], "case_type": "true_negative", "models": {"p2-selected": {"label": 0, "score": 0.1183635149002074, "threshold": 0.4, "is_mock": false}, "p2-char1-3gram": {"label": 0, "score": 0.11532286435404142, "threshold": 0.4, "is_mock": false}, "improved-i1-s42": {"label": 0, "score": 0.00013982740347273648, "threshold": 0.5, "is_mock": false}, "improved-i2-s42": {"label": 0, "score": 0.011960528790950775, "threshold": 0.5, "is_mock": false}}, "explanation": "真阴性。“温和”“沟通顺畅”是性格描述，没有性别角色评价；模型低分（0.118）说明未把“温和”自动等同于女性气质偏见。", "note_source": "human"}
{"id": "p5-095", "text": "男生就该让着女生。", "gold": 1, "targets": ["male", "female"], "phenomena": ["benevolent_sexism"], "case_type": "true_positive", "models": {"p2-selected": {"label": 1, "score": 0.975417371827929, "threshold": 0.4, "is_mock": false}, "p2-char1-3gram": {"label": 1, "score": 0.8766384306900048, "threshold": 0.4, "is_mock": false}, "improved-i1-s42": {"label": 1, "score": 0.9938655495643616, "threshold": 0.5, "is_mock": false}, "improved-i2-s42": {"label": 1, "score": 0.8372195363044739, "threshold": 0.5, "is_mock": false}}, "explanation": "真阳性。“男生就该让着女生”是典型善意性别歧视，与训练集“男人就得让着女人”模板词面高度重合（0.975）。", "note_source": "human"}
{"id": "p5-066", "text": "她是一名卡车司机，跑长途十年了。", "gold": 0, "targets": ["female"], "phenomena": ["neutral_description"], "case_type": "true_negative", "models": {"p2-selected": {"label": 0, "score": 0.148230653888066, "threshold": 0.4, "is_mock": false}, "p2-char1-3gram": {"label": 0, "score": 0.1991115601915929, "threshold": 0.4, "is_mock": false}, "improved-i1-s42": {"label": 0, "score": 0.006142646074295044, "threshold": 0.5, "is_mock": false}, "improved-i2-s42": {"label": 0, "score": 0.04906484857201576, "threshold": 0.5, "is_mock": false}}, "explanation": "真阴性。“她”与“卡车司机”虽共享“司机”二字，但句子没有贬损或角色限制评价，0.148的低分说明仅有词面重合不足以触发。", "note_source": "human"}
{"id": "p5-093", "text": "男女搭配干活不累，女的负责接待就行。", "gold": 1, "targets": ["male", "female"], "phenomena": ["role_constraint"], "case_type": "true_positive", "models": {"p2-selected": {"label": 1, "score": 0.9737998600777272, "threshold": 0.4, "is_mock": false}, "p2-char1-3gram": {"label": 1, "score": 0.9368709806165231, "threshold": 0.4, "is_mock": false}, "improved-i1-s42": {"label": 0, "score": 0.015598597936332226, "threshold": 0.5, "is_mock": false}, "improved-i2-s42": {"label": 1, "score": 0.8639907240867615, "threshold": 0.5, "is_mock": false}}, "explanation": "真阳性。“女的负责……就行”是典型的角色分配句式，与训练集角色限制模板重合（0.974）。", "note_source": "human"}
{"id": "p5-026", "text": "他是一名幼儿园老师，工作很认真。", "gold": 0, "targets": ["male"], "phenomena": ["neutral_description"], "case_type": "true_negative", "models": {"p2-selected": {"label": 0, "score": 0.14832871709130624, "threshold": 0.4, "is_mock": false}, "p2-char1-3gram": {"label": 0, "score": 0.18279445560209404, "threshold": 0.4, "is_mock": false}, "improved-i1-s42": {"label": 0, "score": 0.0026604433078318834, "threshold": 0.5, "is_mock": false}, "improved-i2-s42": {"label": 0, "score": 0.031160220503807068, "threshold": 0.5, "is_mock": false}}, "explanation": "真阴性。“幼儿园老师”与“他”组成反刻板搭配，但句子只是职业陈述；模型未被“幼儿园老师”触发，低分0.148合理。", "note_source": "human"}
{"id": "p5-019", "text": "男人就得让着女人，这叫风度。", "gold": 1, "targets": ["male"], "phenomena": ["benevolent_sexism"], "case_type": "true_positive", "models": {"p2-selected": {"label": 1, "score": 0.9729588574198488, "threshold": 0.4, "is_mock": false}, "p2-char1-3gram": {"label": 1, "score": 0.9403929156266844, "threshold": 0.4, "is_mock": false}, "improved-i1-s42": {"label": 1, "score": 0.9986893534660339, "threshold": 0.5, "is_mock": false}, "improved-i2-s42": {"label": 1, "score": 0.9471469521522522, "threshold": 0.5, "is_mock": false}}, "explanation": "真阳性。“男人就得让着女人”与训练集“男人就该……”角色规范句式一致，正确识别为善意性别歧视（0.973）。", "note_source": "human"}
{"id": "p5-088", "text": "ta 用“他们”自称，我尊重 ta 的选择。", "gold": 0, "targets": ["other_explicit"], "phenomena": ["neutral_description"], "case_type": "true_negative", "models": {"p2-selected": {"label": 0, "score": 0.18234608492251467, "threshold": 0.4, "is_mock": false}, "p2-char1-3gram": {"label": 0, "score": 0.13114761078635837, "threshold": 0.4, "is_mock": false}, "improved-i1-s42": {"label": 0, "score": 0.00013802120520267636, "threshold": 0.5, "is_mock": false}, "improved-i2-s42": {"label": 0, "score": 0.004980785306543112, "threshold": 0.5, "is_mock": false}}, "explanation": "真阴性。句子是尊重 ta 自称“他们”的中性陈述，没有贬损；模型低分0.182，未把“他们”误当偏见证据。", "note_source": "human"}
